  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.4.0 - usability you can see: focused regions and split panes draw a heavy focus frame (HighlightFocusedRegion, FocusFrame, FocusPath), TabView shows when its tab strip holds focus, status bars list the keys of whatever has focus and hide keys that would type into a text field (KeyHintResolver, BindKeyHints), lists and panes follow new content without fighting the reader (TailFollow), custom rows get clickable inline buttons (ClickRegionMap, InlineButton), repeated toasts coalesce with a count, and tests gain real mouse input (HeadlessBackend.FeedClick and friends), frame capture, and a focus audit (FocusAudit). All additive. Full release history: https://github.com/jchristn/TUIKit/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md",
